# Atlas web — local development overrides.
#
# Copy to `.env.development.local` (gitignored, Vite loads it automatically
# in dev mode and dev mode only). Every variable here is optional; with none
# set, Atlas's Nova Account client points at the real https://nova.help
# exactly as it does in a shipped build.

# Point the Nova Account client at a local Nova.Help instance instead of the
# production domain — useful before nova.help is actually deployed, or to
# test sign-in without touching production accounts.
#
#   cd D:\Dev\NovaHelp && npm start        # serves on http://127.0.0.1:4400
#   pnpm --filter @atlas/desktop dev:nova-local   # merges the matching CSP override
#
# VITE_NOVA_DEV_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:4400
